---
title: Incline Machine Chest Press
type: docs
prev: docs/grud/
---
![](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/74132d51-0562-4518-9fec-f1b406e2c3d3)


{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Set the desired weight and sit down on the machine.

### Step 2
Grip the handles firmly with both hands.

### Step 3
Exhale and press the handles upward until your arms are extended. Hold for one second at the top, squeezing your chest muscles.

### Step 4
Inhale and slowly lower the handles back to the starting position.

### Step 5
Repeat for the desired number of reps.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Press all the way up, but avoid locking your elbows aggressively at the top.

• Do not pause at the bottom—keep the movement smooth and continuous.

• Keep your chest lifted, shoulder blades pulled together, and shoulders back.

• Keep your hips and upper back pressed firmly against the backrest with a slight natural arch in your lower back.

• Work through the full range of motion to get the best muscle stretch and contraction.
{{< /callout >}}
